<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fighting Staff</h1>
<p>A powerful weapon, the fighting staff is a full staff of hard wood, used 
in two hands: a stronger, better made cousin of the quarter staff.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="In_Valhalla">In Valhalla</span></h2>
<p>In Valhalla the fighting staff is fought with the quarterstaff skill, one 
of the polearms (see <a cmd='#'>Help Quarterstaff</a>): two-handed, it bludgeons. The 
only fighting staves are the ones rangers carve from a fallen branch in the 
forest once they have mastered fashion weapon (see <a cmd='#'>Help Fashion Weapon</a>). 
It fights no better than a quarter staff the same ranger carves: how well 
made either one is depends on the ranger's skill. It is only heavier.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
